                                "sense_id": "51cb5a10-bad7-3850-b81c-93269eba729f",
                                "text": "July 15, 1833, Jane Carlyle, letter to Thomas Carlyle\nMy brother-in-law is a paragon of the class, but he is so by—in as much as possible—undoctoring himself."
